  "description": "Cloudflare Hyperdrive hosting integration for Aspire. Provisions a Hyperdrive configuration at 'aspire deploy' that accelerates a (typically third-party) production database, and surfaces the config id for a Worker binding. Hosting-only — Hyperdrive is consumed via a Worker binding, not over HTTP, so there is no .NET client. The local dev loop uses your existing Aspire database resource unchanged.",
